film-matinee

============================================================
Special thanks: bradautomates/claude-video
============================================================

  https://github.com/bradautomates/claude-video

claude-video's URL ingestion, native-caption-first, WebVTT cleanup,
Whisper-compatible multipart transcription, and agent workflow provided
important inspiration for film-matinee's source preparation and independent
ASR track. film-matinee includes adapted workflow and parsing ideas from that
project while retaining its own long-form visual sheets, color bands, audio
rails, linear chunk reader, and shared annotation system.

